    ["<DecH>工艺：</>雾灰精纺・暗纹提花・占卜之服\n即便在命运的巨变到来之际，也别忘记嘴角上扬，嘲弄于它。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Fog-gray Fine-spun · Dark Pattern Jacquard · Divination Garb \n Even when the great changes of fate arrive, do not forget to raise the corners of your mouth and mock them.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011030\" color=\"#f4a067\">太阳誓约</>范围内施放<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011070\" color=\"#f4a067\">惩戒</>，将减少<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011030\" color=\"#f4a067\">太阳誓约</>冷却时间1.5秒。"] = "Casting <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011070\" color=\"#f4a067\">Punishment</> within the range of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011030\" color=\"#f4a067\">Solar Oath</> reduces the cooldown of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011030\" color=\"#f4a067\">Solar Oath</> by 1.5 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">信息洪流</>改为围绕自身旋转，且会跟随自身移动，技能期间自身获得10%减伤、25%加速，增益最多持续7秒;<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">窥秘之眼</>的击退效果变为100%基础概率的击飞，伤害提高18%"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Torrent of Information</> now rotates around you and follows your movement. While active, you gain 10% damage reduction and 25% acceleration for up to 7 seconds; <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">Eyes of Mystery Prying</> knockback becomes a knockup with a 100% base chance, and its damage is increased by 18%.",
    ["<P_Heart>（似乎有所感应）</>你……身上有乌达留下的力量，是祂让你来的么？"] = "<P_Heart> (seems to sense something) </> You... have the power left by Uda on you. Did He send you here?",
