    ["Actor4中景"] = "Actor4 Medium Shot",
    ["“歌剧魅影”是贝克兰德最负盛名的时装盛典。"] = "\"The Phantom of the Opera\" is Backlund's most prestigious fashion gala.",
    ["“破晓之时”挑战赛"] = "\"Dawn's Arrival\" Challenge Tournament",
    ["“魔女的滋味真不错啊！”——罗塞尔.古斯塔夫"] = "\"The taste of the Witch is truly not bad!\" — Roselle Gustav",
    ["　　邓恩和戴莉认识之后，戴莉就以“自己的羽毛掉光了，好冷”为理由在邓恩头上筑了巢，并为他重复每个被遗忘的信息；邓恩则载着它巡视森林，用厚厚的灰色皮毛为它挡风，用鹿角为它摘下最高处的浆果。\n\n　　戴莉喜欢趴在它脑袋靠后一些的位置，并时常抱怨它额前的毛发不够厚实。\n\n　　一天，戴莉发现邓恩从地上捡起来什么东西，固定在角上后它发现是自己掉落的羽毛。\n\n 　　“这些羽毛太美了，我舍不得它们就这样被遗忘。”邓恩甩了甩头，“即使我明天就会忘记为什么要这么做，但我的角会记得这种发痒的感觉。”\n\n　　戴莉的心轻轻颤动，她激动地盘旋在邓恩的两角之间，准备一展歌喉抖落几根崭新的羽毛。邓恩阻止了它这种会让自己更冷的行为，请它帮忙整理那些收集好的羽毛。戴莉将它们和一个个木牌挂在一起，让它们在风雪中碰撞，与鹿蹄声和鸟鸣声组成森林的曲调。"] = "    After Dunn and Daly met, Daly built a nest on Dunn's head, using the excuse that 'my feathers have all fallen out, it's so cold,' and repeated every forgotten piece of information to him; Dunn carried it while patrolling the forest, shielding it from the wind with his thick gray fur and picking berries from the highest branches with his antlers. \n\n    Daly liked to lie on the back of his head and often complained that the fur on his forehead wasn't thick enough. \n\n    One day, Daly noticed Dunn picking something up from the ground and fixing it to his antlers, only to realize it was its own fallen feathers. \n\n     'These feathers are too beautiful, I can't bear to let them be forgotten like this.' Dunn shook his head. 'Even if I forget why I'm doing this tomorrow, my antlers will remember this itching sensation.' \n\n    Daly's heart fluttered gently. It circled excitedly between Dunn's two antlers, preparing to show off its voice and shake off a few brand-new feathers. Dunn stopped it from doing something that would make it even colder and asked it to help organize the collected feathers. Daly hung them together with wooden tags, letting them collide in the wind and snow, composing the forest's melody with the sound of deer hooves and bird calls.",
    ["【循声】猫叫"] = "【Sound tracking】Cat meow",
    ["一张镶嵌有珍贵宝石的特殊卡牌，容纳了灵界中关于“美”的概念。在被灵界生物带回现实后，能够化作不同种类的最为珍贵的美神收藏品。"] = "A special card inlaid with precious gems, containing the concept of \"beauty\" from the Spirit World. After being brought back to reality by Spirit World creatures, it can transform into various types of the most precious Goddess of Beauty collectibles.",
