    ["书摊老板说是典藏版，花了我不少钱。我想照着格尔曼做过的事也做一遍，回头好跟女儿搭上话。您能否陪我走一趟？替我做个见证。"] = "The book stall owner said it was a collector's edition, it cost me quite a bit. I want to do everything Gehrman did, so I can strike up a conversation with my daughter later. Could you accompany me? Act as a witness for me.",
