    ["休息室中央的钢琴流淌出动人的音乐，吧台和座椅附近学员们互相碰杯，窗外，灵界光影流动。\n你静静地注视着这些事物。"] = "Moving Music flowed from the piano in the center of the lounge, students clinked glasses near the bar and seats, and outside the window, the light and shadows of the Spirit World flowed. \n You watched these things quietly.",
    ["体面的工作需要体面的衣服，是时候给你置办一套像样的正装了。"] = "A decent job requires decent clothes. It's time to get you a proper formal suit.",
    ["你陷入无尽循环的噩梦，经历多次死亡和意志的摧残后，再次从森林中醒来，但除了胸口和太阳穴的疼痛，什么都想不起来。经过调查，你按照羊皮纸上的启示，找齐三个预言之物，却意外闯入向邪神献祭的仪式。幸好“愚者”先生及时出现，为你嫁接来自未来命运中的力量，帮助你对抗梦中残留的污染。你没有向邪神屈服，最终觉醒不灭之力，战胜“月之污染”。在“愚者”先生和塔罗会的帮助下，你身上的污染被暂时封印，即将从现实中醒来。"] = "You fall into an endless cycle of nightmares, and after experiencing multiple deaths and the destruction of your will, you wake up in the forest again, but except for the pain in your chest and temples, you can't remember anything. After investigation, you follow the revelations on the parchment and find the three prophetic items, but accidentally intrude upon a sacrifice ritual to an evil god. Fortunately, Mr. Fool appears in time to graft power from future fate onto you, helping you resist the corruption remaining in your dream. You do not submit to the evil god, eventually awakening the Undying Power and defeating the \"Moon Corruption.\" With the help of Mr. Fool and the Tarot Club, the corruption on you is temporarily sealed, and you are about to wake up in reality.",
